3fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b3a78a4b4994362206d4f9d06042923", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/176ac441/uploads/origins/3741319e-ab29-4f93-a3b1-6bc8474d04aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b3a78a4b4994362206d4f9d06042923, https://si.imgix.net/176ac441/uploads/origins/3741319e-ab29-4f93-a3b1-6bc8474d04aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2dcb57305e4e64f2cf4cee6c3f153335 2x, https://si.imgix.net/176ac441/uploads/origins/3741319e-ab29-4f93-a3b1-6bc8474d04aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce49f7a7d82e8a2673fe568fe7d05feb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "ユーレイにラブラブ甘々種搾りプレスで逆レイプされたいです！\n\n可愛い女の子みたいなショタになって、母性溢れるユーレイさんに甘えながらたっぷり搾り取られたいです！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tikurin_leaf/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/befd12e7/uploads/origins/73c65f04-7798-467e-86de-fba5202fa210?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d48117f7c88fb9045fc6dfd958bd2203", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/befd12e7/uploads/origins/73c65f04-7798-467e-86de-fba5202fa210?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d48117f7c88fb9045fc6dfd958bd2203, https://si.imgix.net/befd12e7/uploads/origins/73c65f04-7798-467e-86de-fba5202fa210?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=dcf283e78fb5bd2f7c34ada8bf3a8d15 2x, https://si.imgix.net/befd12e7/uploads/origins/73c65f04-7798-467e-86de-fba5202fa210?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1db82474c9094f92dd74c7f7a639afff 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tikurin_leaf/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7bc15f8d/requests/208940_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=accc3c57ae0407052638c7ac93ea6cb2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7bc15f8d/requests/208940_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=accc3c57ae0407052638c7ac93ea6cb2, https://si.imgix.net/7bc15f8d/requests/208940_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb44bac93da098ea003f3b9abe95a870 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7bc15f8d/requests/208940_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b79780bb6972f2265e1ffcfea69dc115 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "ノエルが思ったよりも巨根な上絶倫で、ゴムがつきるまでやられてしまい、同時に体力も尽きてしまっているユーレイさんを描いて欲しいのですがよろしいでしょうか？出来ればノエル視点でお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tikurin_leaf/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5a3e4ae6/requests/162537_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9aa500ca1af342c498d4931c914ff74d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5a3e4ae6/requests/162537_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9aa500ca1af342c498d4931c914ff74d, https://si.imgix.net/5a3e4ae6/requests/162537_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=925425daea9133dd44bbd66b13acdc22 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5a3e4ae6/requests/162537_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd7d0f5dc4923e504dad842ecd738743 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "｢痛いのは、一瞬だけだから。｣というタイトルでやってます。上はタイトルないし作者、描いてくださった方が書けるように空けておいてください。小説はガッチガチのリアル調純文学ですが、表紙はほのぼのとした感じにして欲しいです。目が隠れるくらいまである全体的に長髪の黒寄りの灰色の髪をした、左手にあたる部分が欠損し、袖を結んでいる状態の、女性的な顔立ちの男子高校生と、ヴィクトリア朝のワンピースのようなナース服を着た、天使の輪(液体に近い)が付いているサイドテールの女の子(目の色はお任せします)が隣合ってるイメージで書いて欲しいです！ちなみに、男の子の方は女の子に何か言い立てられて困っているような表情、ポーズにして欲しいです。身長は2人とも同じくらいでお願いします！あ、蛇足ですが、タイトルは書いても書かなくても大丈夫です！毎度言葉足らずで申し訳ない！！よろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tikurin_leaf/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/64cf8512/requests/156875_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5edbf513914d656a78f266e36eb24fd7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/64cf8512/requests/156875_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5edbf513914d656a78f266e36eb24fd7, https://si.imgix.net/64cf8512/requests/156875_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e4524a9b246a17d298a835e9159b5d8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/64cf8512/requests/156875_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ec416f5ac90c3c3f7d53c08cd4afb2a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I'd love for you to draw a shota robot! I would be happy to wear a ponytail and some sort of maid's outfit. My face is more than human, I have a feminine face, yellow eyes, and a mature personality. I don't have a transformation mechanism, I can split my body joints like Turn X's Bloody Siege and shoot beams! I want it to be slender and not too pointy looking. I'd like to set up a mentor/student relationship with a certain head maid, and one day I'd like to set up ...... as a mentor! I wouldn't go so far as to say ......, but I'd be very happy to collaborate with you in some way! The name should be \"NoEl\" written as No. 31! I'm sorry for my lack of words! Thank you very much for your cooperation!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tikurin_leaf/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3c0d10d3/requests/117444_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10d687a20301bd8fd3bac3b628097724", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3c0d10d3/requests/117444_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10d687a20301bd8fd3bac3b628097724, https://si.imgix.net/3c0d10d3/requests/117444_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da4250073e0f050963ee18c1d7500cc7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3c0d10d3/requests/117444_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d229728457dabe8e34c8d07575b8b777 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you for your help on pixiv. My name is Alai. I still don't know where to go from here or there, but I would appreciate your help. I would like you to draw a male mecha that looks like it could be from a dark fantasy. He has the appearance of medieval armor, and his physique is generally muscular, but not too burly! I'll leave the exterior details to you! The head is usually red and yellow odd eyes, but when it's ready to fight, it transforms into four eyes, and I want the odd eyes to be placed in opposite directions. Also, I want the mouth area to look like teeth when it's deformed! I don't have a weapon, I fight with my fists. I'd like to see some kind of gimmick on his arms, but I'll leave that up to you. I'm not sure if I should write my name down, but I'll write it down as Roy Armis. Again, thank you for your support!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}